id=tailtrace-priv
name=TailTrace (privileged install)
version=v0.6.0
versionCode=22
author=TailTrace
description=Installs TailTrace systemlessly as /system/priv-app and allowlists READ_PRECISE_PHONE_STATE + MODIFY_PHONE_STATE, enabling registration-reject detection (IMSI-catcher indicator) on official LineageOS builds without recompiling the OS.
